; PropGuard -- The5ers Hyper Growth preset. HARDEST of the three firms: 3% daily (pause
; only) and a 6% max DD floor -- materially tighter than FTMO/FundingPips/High Stakes.
;
; Internal thresholds are NOT copied from the FTMO preset -- they are scaled to the same
; fraction of THIS firm's tighter budget (matches the 0.8x / 0.5x ratios PROPGUARD_DESIGN.md
; uses for FTMO: dd_hard_halt = 0.8 x firm_max_dd_pct, daily_hard_flatten = 0.5 x
; firm_daily_loss_pct, daily_soft_halt = 0.8 x daily_hard_flatten). Reusing FTMO's absolute
; 8.0 / 2.5 / 2.0 values here would put the internal DD floor (92%) BELOW this firm's real
; 6% floor (94%) -- i.e. looser than the firm's own limit, which is exactly backwards.
;
; Hyper Growth is a single-phase program; PropGuard is a 2-phase state machine, so
; InpPhase2TargetPct=0.0 makes Phase 2 a trivial pass-through (equity already meets a 0%
; target the instant Phase 1's target is hit) -- an approximation, not a perfect model.
; Single trade at ~1.0% risk therefore is also too aggressive for the daily budget here;
; InpChallengeBaseRiskPct is reduced accordingly (see the risk-vs-speed math in the
; approved plan §1 -- risk-per-trade is capped by the daily-loss arithmetic, not preference).
InpSymbol=XAUUSD
InpMagicNumber=27072604
InpMinLot=0.01
InpMaxLot=10.0
InpFirmDailyLossPct=3.0
InpFirmMaxDdPct=6.0
InpFirmDdIsTrailing=false
InpPhase1TargetPct=10.0
InpPhase2TargetPct=0.0
InpDailySoftHaltPct=1.2
InpDailyHardFlattenPct=1.5
InpDdHardHaltPct=4.8
InpDailyProfitCapPct=2.5
InpTargetProximityPct=1.5
InpCostGateMaxPct=8.0
InpDailyResetServerHour=0
InpFridayCloseHour=20
InpRolloverBlockStartHour=21
InpRolloverBlockEndHour=23
InpChallengeBaseRiskPct=0.50
InpFundedBaseRiskPct=0.25
InpDailyRiskDivisor=3
InpTotalRiskDivisor=8
InpMaxOpenTrades=1
InpAsianStartHour=0
InpAsianEndHour=7
InpBreakoutBufferAtr=0.25
InpStopAtrMult=1.0
InpTargetR=1.5
InpVolBandLow=0.5
InpVolBandHigh=1.5
InpNyRangeStartHour=12
InpNyEntryWindowHours=4.0
InpAtrPeriod=14
InpVolLookbackDays=20
InpLondonEndHour=13
InpNyRangeHours=3.0
InpNyFlatHour=20
InpEnableNewsFilter=true
InpNewsBlackoutMinutes=5
InpHighImpactNewsTimes=
InpCommissionPerLotUsd=7.0
InpSwapEstimatePerLotUsd=0.0
InpStressExtraSpreadPrice=0.0
InpResetJournalOnInit=true
InpShowDashboard=true
InpForceStartPhase=0
